body:
#102795 proposes to fix this issue with changing the [`*.usage` dynamic template](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/824d06c8cf7fd4811a0ff42e3554bc70dbfb7e0a/x-pack/plugin/core/template-resources/src/main/resources/ecs%40mappings.json#L145-L153) as follows:
```
        {
          "ecs_usage_scaled_float": {
            "mapping": {
              "type": "scaled_float",
              "scaling_factor": 1000
            },
            "path_match": "*.usage",
            "unmatch_mapping_type": "object"
          }
        }
```
While this fixes the reported issue, it still leaves room for other failures, for example when ingesting a document that contains:
```
        {
          "chair.usage": "sitting"
        }
```

Therefore, #102807 may be preferable as it would allow to do:
```
        {
          "ecs_usage_scaled_float": {
            "mapping": {
              "type": "scaled_float",
              "scaling_factor": 1000
            },
            "path_match": "*.usage",
            "match_mapping_type": ["long", "double"]
          }
        }
```
